idings of comfort and joy, comfort and joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":49.15,"end":52.15,"text":"O, tidings of comfort and joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":58.36,"end":59.7,"text":"In Bethlehem, in Israel","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":59.7,"end":61.77,"text":"This blessed Babe was born","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":61.77,"end":63.43,"text":"And laid within a manger","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":63.43,"end":65.2,"text":"Upon this blessed morn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":65.2,"end":66.87,"text":"The which His Mother Mary","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":66.87,"end":68.55,"text":"Did nothing take in scorn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":68.55,"end":71.55,"text":"O, tidings of comfort and joy, comfort and joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":71.83,"end":74.83,"text":"O, tidings of comfort and joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":80.8,"end":82.45,"text":"\"Fear not then,\" said the Angel","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":82.45,"end":84.11,"text":"\"Let nothing you affright","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":84.11,"end":86.07,"text":"This day is born a Saviour","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":86.07,"end":87.81,"text":"Of a pure Virgin bright","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":87.81,"end":89.66,"text":"To free all those who trust in Him","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":89.66,"end":91.28,"text":"From Satan's power and might\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":91.28,"end":94.28,"text":"O, tidings of comfort and joy, comfort and joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":94.89,"end":97.89,"text":"O, tidings of comfort and joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":119.57,"end":122.57,"text":"God rest ye merry gentlem